      "name": "review-sheet-script",
      "title": "The review sheet's Apps Script",
      "description": "Build, install and reuse the Google Apps Script that keeps a review sheet's links and joined columns current (Tool `review-sheet-sync`). Public-comment mode: comment numbers, sections, pages and lines link into the frozen review draft, and Review Change Sets joins its comments. Drafting mode: one Contributor Feedback tab where each row is a change set with its own GitHub issue, and Sections pick from the document's table of contents. Use when setting up either sheet for a document, when its links are missing or stale, or after a tab, header, anchor or draft link changes.",
